INFO  2026-10-01 00:06:44,156 [shard 0:main] main - application.cc:859 - redpanda.health_monitor_metrics_enabled:false	- Whether the cluster_health_* metrics are exported. When enabled, each broker refreshes them on an interval of 10x `health_monitor_max_metadata_age`, so the two scale together. Refreshing increases CPU usage and network traffic. Disabled by default.
