INFO  2026-10-01 00:06:44,157 [shard 0:main] main - application.cc:859 - redpanda.oidc_discovery_url:https://auth.prd.cloud.redpanda.com/.well-known/openid-configuration	- The URL pointing to the well-known discovery endpoint for the OIDC provider.
