INFO  2026-10-01 00:10:13,198 [shard 0:main] main - application.cc:859 - redpanda.cloud_storage_disable_remote_labels_for_tests:false	- If 'true', Redpanda disables remote labels and falls back on the hash-based object naming scheme for new topics. This property exists to simplify testing and shouldn't be set in production.
INFO  2026-10-01 00:10:13,198 [shard 0:main] main - application.cc:859 - redpanda.cloud_storage_disable_tls:false	- Disable TLS for all object storage connections.
INFO  2026-10-01 00:10:13,198 [shard 0:main] main - application.cc:859 - redpanda.cloud_storage_disable_upload_consistency_checks:false	- Disable all upload consistency checks. This will allow redpanda to upload logs with gaps and replicate metadata with consistency violations. Normally, this options should be disabled.
INFO  2026-10-01 00:10:13,198 [shard 0:main] main - application.cc:859 - redpanda.cloud_storage_disable_upload_loop_for_tests:false	- Begins the upload loop in tiered-storage-enabled topic partitions. The property exists to simplify testing and shouldn't be set in production.
INFO  2026-10-01 00:10:13,198 [shard 0:main] main - application.cc:859 - redpanda.cloud_storage_enable_compacted_topic_reupload:true	- Enable re-uploading data for compacted topics
INFO  2026-10-01 00:10:13,198 [shard 0:main] main - application.cc:859 - redpanda.cloud_storage_enable_remote_allow_gaps:false	- Controls the eviction of locally-stored log segments when Tiered Storage uploads are paused. Set to `false` (default) to only evict data that has already been uploaded to cloud storage. If the retained data fills the local volume, Redpanda will throttle producers. Set to `true` to allow the eviction of locally-stored log segments, which may create gaps in offsets.
INFO  2026-10-01 00:10:13,198 [shard 0:main] main - application.cc:859 - redpanda.cloud_storage_enable_remote_read:false	- Default remote read config value for new topics
INFO  2026-10-01 00:10:13,198 [shard 0:main] main - application.cc:859 - redpanda.cloud_storage_enable_remote_write:false	- Default remote write value for new topics
