INFO  2026-10-01 00:10:13,199 [shard 0:main] main - application.cc:859 - redpanda.cloud_storage_enable_segment_merging:true	- Enables adjacent segment merging. The segments are reuploaded if there is an opportunity for that and if it will improve the tiered-storage performance
