INFO  2026-10-01 00:10:13,199 [shard 0:main] main - application.cc:859 - redpanda.kafka_throughput_control:[]	- List of throughput control groups that define exclusions from node-wide throughput limits. Clients excluded from node-wide throughput limits are still potentially subject to client-specific throughput limits. For more information see https://docs.redpanda.com/current/reference/properties/cluster-properties/#kafka_throughput_control.
