INFO  2026-10-01 00:10:13,199 [shard 0:main] main - application.cc:859 - redpanda.memory_enable_memory_sampling:true	- When `true`, memory allocations are sampled and tracked. A sampled live set of allocations can then be retrieved from the Admin API. Additionally, Redpanda will periodically log the top-n allocation sites.
INFO  2026-10-01 00:10:13,199 [shard 0:main] main - application.cc:859 - redpanda.metadata_dissemination_interval_ms:3000ms	- Interval for metadata dissemination batching.
